### Room Shifting LPU — API Testing Guide

Ensure your server is running first:
```bash
cd server
npm run dev
```

---

### 1. Test Server Health
GET http://localhost:5001/health

### 2. Register a Student
POST http://localhost:5001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul Kumar",
  "reg_id": "12204567",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "hostel": "BH-1",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Login
POST http://localhost:5001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reg_id": "12204567",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Check Current User Session (/me)
GET http://localhost:5001/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN_HERE>

### 5. Create a Room Listing (Protected)
POST http://localhost:5001/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN_HERE>

{
  "hostel_name": "BH-1",
  "room_number": "304",
  "block": "A",
  "room_type": "AC",
  "seater": 3,
  "floor": 3,
  "description": "Clean 3-seater corner room near lift with balcony",
  "photos": [
    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555854877-bab0e564b8d5",
    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522771739844-6a9f6d5f14af"
  ]
}

### 6. Filter & Search Rooms (Public)
GET http://localhost:5001/api/rooms?hostel=BH-1&type=AC&seater=3

### 7. Get Room Details by ID
GET http://localhost:5001/api/rooms/1

### 8. View Owner Contact / WhatsApp (Protected)
GET http://localhost:5001/api/rooms/1/contact
Authorization: Bearer <PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN_HERE>
